      "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 16 2022 18:49:59 GMT+0000",
      "text": "The streets of north Philadelphia are no strangers to poverty and violence. But inside Temple University Hospital’s Level 1 Surgical ICU, a dedicated team of nurses come together every day for a shared purpose. Together, they face trauma after trauma head on – all the while quietly helping to strengthen their community. Through their shared experiences of tremendous grief, miraculous recoveries, and everything in between, this unit has become a family and forged unbreakable bonds. This is their story. Do you know an exceptional nurse who truly goes above and beyond? Nominate a hero for our Caregiver Stories series",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 16 2022 18:53:50 GMT+0000",
